  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CHRR/CEDEP Promotion of LGBT Rights ph. II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project&#x2019;s main goal is to contribute to the creation of an enabling social, policy and legal environment for the full realisation of LGBTI rights in Malawi
Objective 1: to enhance and achieve continuous and sustainable LGBTI rights public education and awareness through media and other communication channels
Objective 2: to improve legal and policy environment for LGBTI community in Malawi
Objective 3: to broaden and enhance collaboration and networking with like-minded CSOs</narrative>
  </description>
